00:35.151 --> 00:36.781
<b>Th-This can't be happening!</b>

00:37.071 --> 00:40.791
<b>{Even }Groribas was defeated? 
He was one of our best warriors{same "elite fighter" he mentions later}!</b>

00:44.911 --> 00:49.251
<b>What manner of creature is he? 
And how'd he get aboard?</b>

00:49.251 --> 00:50.251
<b>Dammit!</b>

00:50.251 --> 00:53.131
<b>Melzargard was supposed to be guarding the ship!</b>

00:53.461 --> 00:58.221
<b>Now he and I are the only elite fighters left!</b>

00:59.511 --> 01:01.471
<b>I bet he's just screwing around…</b>

01:01.471 --> 01:03.181
<b>I need him now!</b>

01:03.181 --> 01:03.851
<b>Dammit!</b>

01:03.851 --> 01:06.141
<b>Geryuganshoop, what is the problem?</b>

01:06.441 --> 01:09.691
<b>Lord Boros! I-I am terribly sorry.</b>

01:10.021 --> 01:13.901
<b>One of the natives has 
managed to infiltrate the ship.{We have allowed one of the natives to infiltrate the ship.}</b>

01:13.901 --> 01:18.951
<b>In the mere four minutes since coming aboard, 
he has damaged 23% of the ship.</b>

01:18.951 --> 01:20.911
<b>It seems he is alone,</b>

01:20.911 --> 01:25.461
<b>but he has managed to instantly kill every warrior sent to intercept him.</b>

01:25.461 --> 01:26.461
<b>Do not panic.</b>

01:27.041 --> 01:29.711
<b>As long as the power sphere{core?} is safe,</b>

01:29.711 --> 01:31.961
<b>the ship will not go down.</b>

01:32.841 --> 01:36.971
<b>The damage so far is limited to the crew's living quarters.</b>

01:37.301 --> 01:40.301
<b>But the lesser warriors{minnows}{small fries}{I'LL HAVE A LARGE SODA} won't be enough.</b>

01:40.301 --> 01:41.511
<b>Geryuganshoop…</b>

01:41.511 --> 01:45.351
<b>You, Groribas, and Melzargard are my top lieutenants.{3 "elite fighter"}</b>

01:45.351 --> 01:46.851
<b>Eliminate this intruder.</b>

01:47.481 --> 01:51.231
<b>Groribas has fallen, sir…</b>

01:52.481 --> 01:53.481
<b>What?</b>

01:53.481 --> 01:56.571
<b>L-Let me get Melzargard back here!</b>

01:56.571 --> 02:01.531
<b>He and I together will wipe out 
the intruder without fail!</b>

