03:54.811 --> 04:01.401
<b><i>We have more information on the enormous flying object that has suddenly appeared</i></b>

04:01.401 --> 04:03.321
<b><i>in the skies over City A.</i></b>

04:04.241 --> 04:05.951
<b><i>I'm here at the scene.</i></b>

04:05.951 --> 04:10.241
<b><i>As you can see, all the main roads 
leading to City A have been closed,</i></b>

04:10.621 --> 04:12.581
<b><i>and a state of emergency has been declared.</i></b>

04:14.121 --> 04:16.001
<b><i>According to survivors,</i></b>

04:16.001 --> 04:19.461
<b><i>City A has been almost entirely demolished.</i></b>

