04:24.931 --> 04:32.931
<b>MYSTERY CRAFT IN SKIES ABOVE CITY A</b>

04:28.891 --> 04:32.931
<b><i>This image of the giant flying object was captured with a telephoto lens{telecamera}.{security camera? amateur cameraman?}</i></b>

04:33.431 --> 04:35.061
<b><i>What are your thoughts?</i></b>

04:36.061 --> 04:39.571
<b><i>Most likely, this is the act of an alien or extraterrestrial being.</i></b>

04:40.071 --> 04:44.951
<b><i>Or perhaps it's a life-form from an unknown, highly advanced civilization.{an unidentified life-form that belongs to a highly advanced civilization unbeknownst to us.}</i></b>

04:44.951 --> 04:49.241
<b><i>Of course, other possibilities exist as well.</i></b>

04:49.241 --> 04:50.281
<b><i>I see.</i></b>

04:52.621 --> 04:54.331
<b><i>Also, eyewitnesses report{there have been eyewitness accounts}</i></b>

04:54.331 --> 04:59.251
<b><i>{of }seeing very powerful life-forms descending to the ground from the spacecraft.</i></b>

04:59.251 --> 05:04.971
<b><i>Several S-class heroes are presently at ground zero dealing with the situation{at the location tackling the issue}.</i></b>

05:19.771 --> 05:23.281
<b><i>He pummeled that thing with nothing but his bare fists.</i></b>

05:23.611 --> 05:25.571
<b><i>Truly an S-class hero.{That's a Class S for you.}</i></b>

05:26.151 --> 05:27.281
<b><i>But even so…</i></b>

05:31.081 --> 05:32.991
<b>It's no good!</b>

05:32.991 --> 05:35.541
<b>It possesses incredible regenerative powers!</b>

05:35.541 --> 05:39.131
<b>And don't let it hit any part of you!</b>

05:39.131 --> 05:41.711
<b>A single blow instantly tore my arm off.</b>

05:44.211 --> 05:46.631
<b>Avoid its attacks at all costs!</b>

05:47.431 --> 05:49.551
<b>If I may cut in…</b>

06:01.061 --> 06:04.191
<b>Shall we use a bombardment to finish them off?</b>

06:04.191 --> 06:05.741
<b>That is good.</b>

06:05.741 --> 06:07.781
<b>Contact the ship.</b>

06:08.241 --> 06:09.741
<b>{I will go.}On my way.</b>

06:11.451 --> 06:13.121
<b>{Get back here!}Where do you think you're going?!</b>

06:14.491 --> 06:15.871
<b>You scum!</b>

06:15.871 --> 06:18.791
<b>Best mind your manners!</b>

06:20.251 --> 06:22.631
<b>I hope ya like mincemeat, freak!</b>

06:23.381 --> 06:26.051
<b><i>Melzargard! What are you doing?!</i></b>

06:26.051 --> 06:27.261
<b><i>I'm in battle.</i></b>

06:27.261 --> 06:28.511
<b><i>We have an intruder!</i></b>

06:29.051 --> 06:30.131
<b><i>Nonsense.{Ridiculous.}{Impossible.}</i></b>

06:30.131 --> 06:31.301
<b><i>It's true.</i></b>

06:31.301 --> 06:33.971
<b><i>Finish them off and get up here right now!{+ hurry}</i></b>

06:41.771 --> 06:43.481
<b>This one's locked too.</b>

06:44.071 --> 06:45.651
<b>Hey, open up!</b>

06:45.651 --> 06:47.151
<b>You've got a visitor!</b>

06:49.321 --> 06:50.781
<b><i>Oops… I broke it.</i></b>

06:59.911 --> 07:01.081
<b>I've decided.</b>

07:01.081 --> 07:05.001
<b>I'm going to rip your limbs off, 
then keep you as the ship mascot.</b>

07:05.001 --> 07:06.921
<b>That is good.</b>

07:08.511 --> 07:11.181
<b>So ya put yourself back together again, eh?</b>

07:13.181 --> 07:16.011
<b>I'm gonna keep ya for batting practice!</b>

07:35.951 --> 07:37.121
<b>Comrades!{Friends!}{awkward}{eh not too much}</b>

07:37.121 --> 07:41.661
<b>It seems that direct physical attacks are ineffective!{It may be that direct physical attacks have no effect on it!}</b>

07:42.041 --> 07:47.421
<b>Let's withdraw for now and think of another way 
to destroy it, like heat or something!</b>

07:47.421 --> 07:49.761
<b>Smashing is all I can do!</b>

07:49.761 --> 07:51.171
<b>Forget it!</b>

07:51.631 --> 07:54.181
<b>This is all I know, too.</b>

07:54.181 --> 07:57.181
<b>Can't teach an old dog new tricks.</b>

07:57.511 --> 08:00.931
<b>Me, too. Sorry, sweet Iaian!</b>

08:01.271 --> 08:05.061
<b>Iai, don't you have faith in me?</b>

08:05.061 --> 08:06.941
<b>There's nothing I can't cut down!</b>

08:08.611 --> 08:09.941
<b><i>It's pointless…</i></b>

08:10.781 --> 08:14.911
<b><i>These guys are stubborn to a fault.{aren't the type to listen.}</i></b>

08:19.581 --> 08:20.581
<b><i>Melzargard!</i></b>

08:20.871 --> 08:22.711
<b><i>Look, I really need you on the ship.</i></b>

08:22.711 --> 08:25.081
<b><i>Getting rid of the intruder takes priority.</i></b>

08:25.501 --> 08:30.091
<b><i>I'd love to, but I'm busy. 
These creatures are persistent.</i></b>

08:30.421 --> 08:31.841
<b>What{ the hell}?!</b>

08:31.841 --> 08:36.051
<b>The life-forms down there are proving tough to handle too?</b>

08:36.051 --> 08:38.511
<b><i>Nothing tough about them.</i></b>

08:38.511 --> 08:41.061
<b><i>What's with the ship? Is it going down?</i></b>

08:42.561 --> 08:44.191
<b>It's not going down,</b>

08:44.191 --> 08:47.311
<b>but more than half the crew have been killed.</b>

08:47.311 --> 08:48.441
<b><i>What?!</i></b>

08:51.571 --> 08:52.441
<b><i>Listen.</i></b>

08:52.441 --> 08:56.951
<b><i>Begin cleansing my location with a bombardment from the ship!</i></b>

08:56.951 --> 08:59.701
<b>I've got my hands full right now.</b>

08:59.701 --> 09:03.161
<b>Besides, artillery bombardment is a grunt's job{the job of the lower ranks}.</b>

09:03.161 --> 09:06.621
<b><i>Well, I'm currently unable to return to the ship.{I'm in a situation where I can't return to the ship.}{my situation doesn't allow me to return}</i></b>

09:06.621 --> 09:07.671
<b>All right.</b>

09:07.671 --> 09:10.421
<b>I'll notify the artillery crews.</b>

09:10.421 --> 09:13.591
<b>Don't get caught up in the barrage and die!</b>

09:13.591 --> 09:15.341
<b><i></i>Hey, wait!{the audio says it's telepathy but the video says it's speech. wtf}</b>

09:18.091 --> 09:21.061
<b><i>You should come down here and help me.</i></b>

09:21.061 --> 09:22.891
<b><i>That'd be much faster.</i></b>

09:23.641 --> 09:25.981
<b><i>Hey! Geryuganshoop!</i></b>

09:26.891 --> 09:28.101
<b><i>Damn him.</i></b>

09:28.101 --> 09:30.361
<b><i>How tough is this intruder?</i></b>

09:32.861 --> 09:35.821
<b>How 'bout another one?!</b>

09:38.321 --> 09:40.071
<b>More futile attacks.</b>

09:40.071 --> 09:43.831
<b>Although you are exhausting yourself. That is good.</b>

